# Task 156-014 Execution Plan: 3 Yeni ADR Draft

## Hedef
3 yeni ADR draft (MADR v3 format) oluştur:
1. ADR-053: TaskType Taxonomy
2. ADR-055: Hybrid Scoring 5-Layer Pipeline
3. ADR-060: Self-Awareness Propagation (5 channel)

## Dizin Hazırlığı
- `docs/adr/` dizini oluştur (yoksa)

## ADR-053: TaskType Taxonomy
- Status: proposed
- Context: Task tiplerine göre routing ve scoring davranışının farklılaşması gerektiği
- Decision: `audit` | `document-write` | `code-development` + extensibility roadmap
- EffectClass mapping her TaskType için
- Consequences: pos (clear classification, routing accuracy) / neg (categorization overhead)
- Related: ADR-015, ADR-041, ADR-055

## ADR-055: Hybrid Scoring 5-Layer Pipeline
- Status: proposed
- Context: Sprint 154 Bug B + rubric-registry'nin tek katmanlı değerlendirme yetersizliği
- Decision: Schema validation → Gates → Quality scoring → Outcome scoring → Auditor verification
- Consequences: pos (richer evaluation) / neg (pipeline latency, complexity)
- Related: ADR-035, ADR-036, ADR-053

## ADR-060: Self-Awareness Propagation (5 channel)
- Status: proposed
- Context: Worker'ların proje context'inden habersiz çalışması, agent alignment drift
- Decision: 5 kanal: init/sync/manifest/skill-declare/worker-enrichment
- Consequences: pos (context richness) / neg (prompt token cost)
- Related: ADR-036, ADR-007, ADR-041

## Doğrulama
- Bu task sadece docs/ yazıyor, tsc/vitest gerektirmiyor
- Scope: docs/adr/ ONLY
- Min 600 kelime per ADR
